+        /// KNOWN BUG (pinned, deterministic failure): an integer literal in a
+        /// PEEK slice that overflows `i32` parses successfully, but
+        /// `consume_rules` panics via `.parse().unwrap()` (ParseIntError,
+        /// parser.rs `consume_expr` PEEK handling) instead of returning a
+        /// grammar error.
